# Agent Task: Price Drop Alerts

Track price per zpid in KV (hyh:price-history:<zpid> = JSON array of {price, date}). On each scan, compare current price to stored last price. If drop >= 2%, add zpid back to the scoring queue even if already in seen-ids. Add 🔻 badge on listing card showing dollar drop. Store price history with 180-day TTL.

## Test requirements
Unit tests for: drop percentage calculation, 2% threshold boundary, re-queue logic, badge formatting ($15,000 → '$15k').
